 Features
Scrapes book titles & prices (GBP)

Live currency conversion (KES, USD, EUR, etc.)

Interactive menu for currency selection

Exports to CSV, JSON, and PNG chart

Error handling for network issues

 Quick Start
bash
# 1. Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv
source venv/Scripts/activate  

# 2. Install dependencies
pip install requests beautifulsoup4 pandas matplotlib

# 3. Run script
python pricescraper.py
